es learners using generative AI in their work to openly indicate the form and scope of use and mark generated text fragments or objects; content generated with AI but not indicated is not recognized as content created by the learner.","sourceUrls":["https://www.sggw.edu.pl/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Zarzadzenie-Nr-93-Rektora-Szkoly-Glownej-Gospodarstwa-Wiejskiego-w-Warszawie-z-dnia-26-wrzesnia-2024-r.-5.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:claim-sggw-genai-ordinance-source","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"source_status","claimId":"claim-sggw-genai-ordinance-source","matchMethod":"none","newText":"SGGW publishes Rector Ordinance No. 93 on the principles for using generative artificial intelligence tools in the works of persons undergoing education at the university.","sourceUrls":["https://www.sggw.edu.pl/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Zarzadzenie-Nr-93-Rektora-Szkoly-Glownej-Gospodarstwa-Wiejskiego-w-Warszawie-z-dnia-26-wrzesnia-2024-r.-5.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:claim-sggw-public-genai-data-restriction","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"privacy","claimId":"claim-sggw-public-genai-data-restriction","matchMethod":"none","newText":"SGGW says a learner may not submit personal data, legally protected secrets, third-party copyrighted works, or SGGW commercialization-related creative-result data to publicly available generative AI tools.","sourceUrls":["https://www.sggw.edu.pl/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Zarzadzenie-Nr-93-Rektora-Szkoly-Glownej-Gospodarstwa-Wiejskiego-w-Warszawie-z-dnia-26-wrzesnia-2024-r.-5.pdf"]},{"id":"source_added:https://www.sggw.edu.pl/studenci/praca-dyplomowa/","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://www.sggw.edu.pl/studenci/praca-dyplomowa/"]},{"id":"source_added:https://www.sggw.edu.pl/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Zarzadzenie-Nr-93-Rektora-Szkoly-Glownej-Gospodarstwa-Wiejskiego-w-Warszawie-z-dnia-26-wrzesnia-2024-r.-5.pdf","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","